Included third-party compatibility subsets

- third_party/openpi contains a trimmed and modified OpenPI/pi0 integration
  used by Stage3 policy training and policy execution utilities. Several files
  in this subtree contain Google or Big Vision copyright and Apache-2.0
  license headers. Their upstream license terms remain in effect. See
  third_party/openpi/LICENSE.

- third_party/robocasa contains a trimmed RoboCasa task/environment subset and
  utility code needed for TurnOnSinkFaucet replay and environment execution.
  The upstream RoboCasa license terms remain in effect. See
  third_party/robocasa/LICENSE.

- third_party/wan contains the Wan video-model source subset used by ViVa and
  carried here for REVAMP compatibility. Many files in this subtree include
  "Copyright 2024-2025 The Alibaba Wan Team Authors. All rights reserved."
  headers. The upstream Wan source code is distributed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0; see third_party/wan/LICENSE.

- third_party/wan/utils/fm_solvers.py and
  third_party/wan/utils/fm_solvers_unipc.py state that they were copied from
  Hugging Face Diffusers scheduler implementations. The upstream Diffusers
  license terms remain in effect.

- third_party/wan/utils/qwen_vl_utils.py states that it was copied from
  qwen-vl-utils. The upstream qwen-vl-utils license terms remain in effect.

